WEBVTT

00:00:00.590 --> 00:00:02.730
Amnesia?!

00:00:02.730 --> 00:00:05.480
And how has she "lost her mind," exactly?

00:00:05.660 --> 00:00:08.320
Kuro-nee's been eating 
her meals like normal!

00:00:08.320 --> 00:00:10.250
She's eating like normal?!

00:00:10.250 --> 00:00:12.400
And that's what's so weird!

00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:14.640
She still puts honey on her sashimi, right?

00:00:14.640 --> 00:00:16.490
No, she doesn't.

00:00:16.490 --> 00:00:18.350
Whipped cream on her white rice?

00:00:18.350 --> 00:00:20.250
Unfortunately, no.

00:00:20.560 --> 00:00:23.340
Haru-nii and Dori-nee are 
as hopeless as ever.

00:00:23.340 --> 00:00:25.870
The conversation isn't getting anywhere.

00:00:27.940 --> 00:00:31.210
It sounds like you're having fun,
Sueharu-oniichan.

00:00:31.210 --> 00:00:32.140
No way!

00:00:32.140 --> 00:00:35.330
Kuro-nee shot you down, so you 
brought another woman here?!

00:00:35.640 --> 00:00:37.410
H-Haru-niisan...

00:00:37.410 --> 00:00:39.170
How immoral. I misjudged you.

00:00:39.170 --> 00:00:40.720
Y-You've got it all wrong!

00:00:40.720 --> 00:00:43.940
We were both child actors. 
Her name's Momosaka Maria.

00:00:43.940 --> 00:00:47.310
Momosaka Maria? The one from 
<i>The Perfect Little Sister<i>?!</i></i>

00:00:47.470 --> 00:00:49.010
Who are they?

00:00:49.300 --> 00:00:52.640
They're the younger sisters of Kuroha,
 the girl you met today.

00:00:53.050 --> 00:00:56.650
They live next door, so they've always 
been like my own little sisters.

00:00:56.850 --> 00:00:58.110
Oh...

00:00:58.390 --> 00:01:00.450
The big one is the second daughter, Midori.

00:01:00.450 --> 00:01:03.520
Middle school third-year. 
A bit violent, but athletic.

00:01:03.790 --> 00:01:05.690
She plays tennis on the national level.

00:01:05.690 --> 00:01:07.070
You didn't need to call me violent!

00:01:07.410 --> 00:01:10.480
That's the third daughter, Aoi-chan. 
Middle school first-year.

00:01:10.480 --> 00:01:13.420
Shy, but kind. She's basically an angel.

00:01:13.420 --> 00:01:16.180
Gosh, Haru-niisan, you give 
me too much praise.

00:01:16.540 --> 00:01:18.620
And that's the youngest, Akane.

00:01:18.620 --> 00:01:20.750
Middle school first-year, 
and Aoi-chan's twin.

00:01:21.030 --> 00:01:24.070
She's a prodigy who passed level 1 of 
the Global Mathematics Certification.

00:01:24.070 --> 00:01:26.160
That's not such a big deal.

00:01:26.410 --> 00:01:30.230
Including Kuroha, they're known 
as the "Colorful Sisters."

00:01:30.230 --> 00:01:33.260
So they're basically like 
my own sisters, then?

00:01:33.260 --> 00:01:36.830
You can call me "Momo-neesan" if you want.

00:01:38.050 --> 00:01:38.730
Ow!

00:01:38.730 --> 00:01:39.810
Cut it out.

00:01:39.810 --> 00:01:44.130
But Sueharu-oniichan can 
only be <i>my</i> big brother.

00:01:45.920 --> 00:01:49.320
Don't you think you're clinging 
to him a bit too much?

00:01:49.320 --> 00:01:51.340
Are you jealous?

00:01:51.340 --> 00:01:52.880
No, I'm not jealous.

00:01:52.880 --> 00:01:56.890
Anyway, I'm never calling you Momo-neesan!

00:01:56.890 --> 00:01:58.330
Really?

00:01:58.330 --> 00:02:01.270
And here I was thinking about uploading 
a photo of us together

00:02:01.270 --> 00:02:03.420
on social media to celebrate meeting you.

00:02:04.400 --> 00:02:06.310
It would get you a lot 
of attention for sure!

00:02:06.310 --> 00:02:08.180
You could brag to your friends!

00:02:08.180 --> 00:02:10.710
Hmph! Don't think you can bait me with that!

00:02:10.710 --> 00:02:14.410
Aw, but I just wanted us to be friends.

00:02:14.410 --> 00:02:17.270
W-Well, it's not like I'm 
rejecting you personally.

00:02:17.430 --> 00:02:18.930
Oh, that's good!

00:02:18.930 --> 00:02:21.610
You're so easy, Midori-chan! I love it!

00:02:21.610 --> 00:02:23.360
You let the truth slip out.

00:02:25.290 --> 00:02:27.310
Stop messing with me!

00:02:27.310 --> 00:02:30.330
Look, Momo, it's not like you're a neighbor.

00:02:30.330 --> 00:02:31.820
You should go home.

00:02:31.820 --> 00:02:34.810
But I wouldn't mind spending the night.

00:02:35.200 --> 00:02:37.180
Sueharu, you little...

00:02:37.180 --> 00:02:38.800
Chill out, Midori!

00:02:38.800 --> 00:02:40.900
Damn it, Momo, you're doing this on purpose!

00:02:40.900 --> 00:02:42.560
Whatever do you mean?

00:02:42.560 --> 00:02:43.380
Don't play dumb!

00:02:43.380 --> 00:02:45.310
Are you going to punish me?

00:02:45.310 --> 00:02:50.340
By playing doctor like you 
loved to do six years ago?

00:02:50.340 --> 00:02:51.820
Sueharu!

00:02:51.820 --> 00:02:53.740
Haru-niisan's a pervert.

00:02:53.740 --> 00:02:55.020
Haru-nii is a lecher.

00:02:55.020 --> 00:02:56.520
Momo!

00:02:56.520 --> 00:02:58.450
Aw, I'm just kidding.

00:03:12.000 --> 00:03:17.920
Osamake: Romcom Where
The Childhood Friend Won't Lose

00:04:29.440 --> 00:04:33.730
It seems like you're dealing with an emergency,
so I'll leave for today,

00:04:33.730 --> 00:04:38.640
but please consider coming 
back to show business, Sueharu-oniichan!

00:04:41.780 --> 00:04:43.700
I told you!

00:04:43.700 --> 00:04:48.190
All of Kuro-nee's memories from the 
time she confessed to you and got rejected

00:04:48.190 --> 00:04:51.170
up until the cultural festival 
are completely gone!

00:04:51.170 --> 00:04:51.930
Wha...

00:04:51.930 --> 00:04:53.380
Hang on, Midori.

00:04:53.380 --> 00:04:56.760
How do you know Kuro confessed 
to me and got rejected?

00:04:57.790 --> 00:05:00.120
Well, of course Kuro-nee wouldn't tell me!

00:05:00.120 --> 00:05:03.190
But it's obvious from the way 
she acts and stuff, you know?

00:05:03.540 --> 00:05:05.790
I never thought Midori 
could be so sensitive.

00:05:05.790 --> 00:05:09.370
Excuse me?! I'm a girl, you know!
I can tell these things!

00:05:09.370 --> 00:05:11.970
You could act more like a girl, then.

00:05:14.520 --> 00:05:18.140
Okay, sorry. You're very much a girl.

00:05:18.140 --> 00:05:20.210
Hmph. As long as you know.

00:05:20.650 --> 00:05:24.810
Wh-Where are you looking, you pervert?!

00:05:24.810 --> 00:05:25.670
I give! I give!

00:05:26.200 --> 00:05:30.380
But seriously, what are you gonna 
do about Kuro-nee, Sueharu?

00:05:31.410 --> 00:05:32.720
Hey, what's wrong with you?

00:05:32.900 --> 00:05:35.730
Dori-nee, bearing in mind 
everything that's happened,

00:05:35.730 --> 00:05:39.020
there's no doubt that Haru-nii 
is under a lot of stress, too.

00:05:39.020 --> 00:05:40.440
It's dangerous to push him.

00:05:40.660 --> 00:05:43.500
First of all, given the way 
Kuro-nee shot him down,

00:05:43.500 --> 00:05:44.560
he should be bedridden.

00:05:45.770 --> 00:05:49.290
On top of that, the video of it was 
uploaded and got over a million views.

00:05:49.290 --> 00:05:50.070
That's suicide level.

00:05:50.810 --> 00:05:55.050
If you tell him he pushed Kuro-nee to 
the point that she lost her memories,

00:05:55.050 --> 00:05:57.580
he'll have no choice but to commit seppuku.

00:05:59.550 --> 00:06:00.830
H-Haru-niisan?!

00:06:00.990 --> 00:06:03.680
Sorry, Haru-nii. That's not 
what I was trying to do.

00:06:06.380 --> 00:06:07.250
Ow.

00:06:07.880 --> 00:06:10.330
Since you're younger, the apology's enough.

00:06:10.330 --> 00:06:12.510
It's your elders' job to 
smile and forgive you.

00:06:13.020 --> 00:06:14.270
Haru-nii...

00:06:14.270 --> 00:06:16.140
Whose quote was that?

00:06:16.370 --> 00:06:18.610
Ma-chan-san of Acid Snake.

00:06:18.610 --> 00:06:21.160
You know her?! From a drama or what?!

00:06:21.160 --> 00:06:23.300
I'm a huge fan of hers!

00:06:23.300 --> 00:06:26.160
I heard her new song's 
gonna be really extreme!

00:06:26.160 --> 00:06:27.250
Do you know anything about it?

00:06:27.250 --> 00:06:30.030
No, I haven't had any contact 
with her since I retired.

00:06:30.170 --> 00:06:36.490
So, Haru-niisan, Kuro-neesan says she'll get 
you in the morning because she wants to talk.

00:06:37.310 --> 00:06:39.210
Don't try to get out of it, Sueharu.

00:06:39.210 --> 00:06:40.560
Okay, fine.

00:06:41.730 --> 00:06:44.420
Haru-nii, are you going to 
return to show business?

00:06:44.420 --> 00:06:47.610
Where'd that come from? 
I haven't decided yet.

00:06:48.670 --> 00:06:53.120
If you did return to show business,
 I'd be very proud,

00:06:53.120 --> 00:06:54.760
but also sad.

00:06:55.740 --> 00:06:57.980
I wouldn't try to stop you, though.

00:06:58.170 --> 00:06:59.300
Akane...

00:06:59.680 --> 00:07:01.810
If there's one thing I can say, it's that...

00:07:02.710 --> 00:07:06.300
Whether you choose show business or love,

00:07:06.300 --> 00:07:09.740
don't choose from a negative mindset 
of running away from love.

00:07:09.740 --> 00:07:12.720
I want you to make the choice 
with a positive mindset.

00:07:12.720 --> 00:07:16.450
It'll be one of the biggest 
choices you make in your life.

00:07:17.950 --> 00:07:19.780
Thanks, Akane.

00:07:22.630 --> 00:07:25.130
Haru-nii... m-my hands...

00:07:34.160 --> 00:07:35.550
Haru. Good morning.

00:07:35.920 --> 00:07:38.460
H-Hey, good morning.

00:07:39.650 --> 00:07:42.080
Kuro, how much do you remember?

00:07:42.080 --> 00:07:44.130
What's the last memory you have?

00:07:44.130 --> 00:07:46.390
Just before summer break started.

00:07:46.900 --> 00:07:51.170
I remember everything up to when 
I decided to confess to you.

00:07:51.170 --> 00:07:54.240
I watched the video, 
and I have no idea why I did that

00:07:54.240 --> 00:07:56.490
even though I know I love you.

00:07:56.820 --> 00:07:58.510
What do you think, Haru?

00:07:58.510 --> 00:08:01.960
Do you still like me, even after 
I did something so awful?

00:08:01.960 --> 00:08:03.960
D-Do I still...

00:08:04.400 --> 00:08:05.460
No.

00:08:07.170 --> 00:08:09.960
It's okay, Haru. You don't 
have to say any more.

00:08:09.960 --> 00:08:13.130
I know I hurt you really badly.

00:08:14.080 --> 00:08:14.960
I'm sorry.

00:08:15.620 --> 00:08:16.630
Kuro...

00:08:17.010 --> 00:08:19.270
But I want to make it up to you.

00:08:22.560 --> 00:08:25.060
Uh, sorry... I didn't mean to...

00:08:26.660 --> 00:08:28.350
So it's that bad.

00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:31.980
Never mind. It's nothing.

00:08:32.420 --> 00:08:35.050
I can still be close to you, right?

00:08:35.050 --> 00:08:37.230
Of course! Why are you even asking?

00:08:37.510 --> 00:08:41.270
I want to be someone you can trust again.

00:08:41.270 --> 00:08:42.900
It's not like that!

00:08:42.900 --> 00:08:45.840
I'm not trying to put any 
blame on you at all!

00:08:45.840 --> 00:08:49.710
I'm sure you just rejected me because 
I did something dumb again.

00:08:50.690 --> 00:08:51.650
Then...

00:08:52.610 --> 00:08:54.330
Let's start over, Haru.

00:08:54.500 --> 00:08:56.010
Start over?

00:08:56.010 --> 00:08:59.570
I think we just started buttoning 
up from the wrong hole.

00:08:59.840 --> 00:09:04.070
If we start over with the first buttonhole, 
we won't have any more problems.

00:09:04.350 --> 00:09:05.430
Am I wrong?

00:09:05.700 --> 00:09:07.300
No, you're not wrong.

00:09:07.810 --> 00:09:10.100
Kuro, I should be asking you.

00:09:10.100 --> 00:09:11.740
Please stay by my side.

00:09:11.740 --> 00:09:14.040
I know we'll get over this trauma!

00:09:15.420 --> 00:09:16.460
Thanks.

00:09:23.740 --> 00:09:24.660
Su-chan...

00:09:24.660 --> 00:09:26.750
H-Hey, Shiro. What's up?

00:09:31.970 --> 00:09:35.800
The press might be waiting for 
you in front of the school.

00:09:35.800 --> 00:09:38.180
Oh, but Shida-san will be fine, right?

00:09:39.500 --> 00:09:42.650
Shiro, you're way too unfriendly with Kuro.

00:09:42.910 --> 00:09:45.160
I'm not trying to force you to be friends,

00:09:45.160 --> 00:09:47.900
but it's not cool to try to leave her out.

00:09:49.270 --> 00:09:51.520
<i>I thought I was doing the right thing.</i>

00:09:51.770 --> 00:09:52.470
Hey...

00:09:53.130 --> 00:09:56.400
Shida-san left school early yesterday.

00:09:56.400 --> 00:09:57.490
Is she okay now?

00:09:58.830 --> 00:10:02.160
Actually, she seems to 
have a bit of amnesia.

00:10:02.560 --> 00:10:04.320
Amnesia?

00:10:05.360 --> 00:10:06.900
That's what's going on.

00:10:07.080 --> 00:10:08.240
Ahem!

00:10:08.240 --> 00:10:12.210
Haru, you seem to be pretty good 
friends with Kachi-san now.

00:10:12.210 --> 00:10:13.120
What's that about?

00:10:15.100 --> 00:10:17.210
You're curious about our relationship?

00:10:17.210 --> 00:10:19.220
Well, yes. Just a little.

00:10:21.530 --> 00:10:25.730
I don't think Shida-san has 
actually lost her memories.

00:10:25.730 --> 00:10:28.080
Huh? What're you basing that on?

00:10:28.080 --> 00:10:29.460
Girls' intuition.

00:10:31.930 --> 00:10:33.530
Shiro, leave this to me.

00:10:33.900 --> 00:10:35.690
I've got a great idea.

00:10:36.030 --> 00:10:41.030
Osamake: Romcom Where
The Childhood Friend Won't Lose

00:10:36.030 --> 00:10:41.030
<b>\hEpisode 5: 
The Girl Who Lost Her Memories /
The Octopus Wiener Trap</b>

00:10:36.030 --> 00:10:41.030
Whisper Whisper

00:10:36.030 --> 00:10:41.030
Aha!!

00:10:44.740 --> 00:10:46.000
Library Prep Room

00:10:45.120 --> 00:10:48.630
I'm really happy you invited me 
to have a private lunch with you.

00:10:48.830 --> 00:10:52.750
A-Actually, Kuro, I made a bento today.

00:10:53.360 --> 00:10:56.270
Midori told me your sense 
of taste had changed.

00:10:56.840 --> 00:10:58.370
Want to try a bite?

00:10:59.200 --> 00:11:01.310
Kuro once had a traumatic experience.

00:11:01.310 --> 00:11:04.600
Aw, octopus wieners! How cute!

00:11:06.900 --> 00:11:08.680
I can't!

00:11:09.160 --> 00:11:12.560
<i>So unless it's something bad 
enough to cause amnesia,</i>

00:11:12.560 --> 00:11:14.410
<i>her sense of taste shouldn't change.</i>

00:11:14.410 --> 00:11:19.220
<i>That is, there's no way she should
 be able to eat an octopus wiener!</i>

00:11:19.220 --> 00:11:20.620
Okay, I'll have one.

00:11:21.680 --> 00:11:25.070
I'm not sure why, but it 
looks really tasty today.

00:11:25.410 --> 00:11:27.660
Okay, feed me.

00:11:29.610 --> 00:11:32.670
Why did you say "feed me" 
without opening your mouth?

00:11:32.670 --> 00:11:35.230
Got a problem with what 
your big sister is doing?

00:11:35.620 --> 00:11:38.640
If I moved closer to you right now,
 you'd run, wouldn't you?

00:11:38.860 --> 00:11:41.440
Er, no... okay, yes, I would.

00:11:41.440 --> 00:11:44.270
Then what would happen if 
you moved closer to me?

00:11:44.270 --> 00:11:46.600
I get it. You flipped it around.

00:11:46.600 --> 00:11:50.060
So now that you get it, you can feed me.

00:11:50.060 --> 00:11:53.730
Again, why are you telling me to feed 
you and not opening your mouth?!

00:11:56.610 --> 00:11:59.970
I'm gonna be honest. You're so red,
 it's making <i>me</i> embarrassed.

00:12:02.490 --> 00:12:05.240
Jerk! Jerk! Jerk!

00:12:04.660 --> 00:12:08.110
Ow, ow, ow! Forgive me, Kuroha-oneechan!

00:12:11.830 --> 00:12:13.260
Open wide.

00:12:15.080 --> 00:12:17.370
If you'd just done that to begin with...

00:12:17.550 --> 00:12:19.720
Huh? Kuro, what'd you just say?

00:12:19.720 --> 00:12:23.390
Shut up! I didn't want 
you to hear me, anyway!

00:12:23.390 --> 00:12:27.640
O-Okay... fine, then.

00:12:28.170 --> 00:12:29.260
Here it comes.

00:12:35.130 --> 00:12:36.430
Mm, it's good!

00:12:36.750 --> 00:12:38.820
<i>She really does have amnesia.</i>

00:12:39.330 --> 00:12:43.330
By the way, is it true you're 
going back to your old agency?

00:12:43.330 --> 00:12:45.480
Oh, they told you about that?

00:12:45.480 --> 00:12:46.790
I almost forgot. Here.

00:12:47.030 --> 00:12:49.740
President and CEO

00:12:47.620 --> 00:12:49.740
The president of the agency saw that video

00:12:50.030 --> 00:12:52.170
and took an interest in you.

00:12:52.490 --> 00:12:54.670
He wants you to come by with me.

00:12:54.670 --> 00:12:55.630
You're going back?

00:12:56.220 --> 00:12:57.440
I still can't decide.

00:12:57.860 --> 00:13:00.580
So I figured I might as well go talk to him.

00:13:02.240 --> 00:13:04.330
Are you opposed to me going back?

00:13:04.550 --> 00:13:06.630
If I had to say one way or the other, I am.

00:13:06.630 --> 00:13:10.790
Because I've seen how much 
pain you've been through.

00:13:10.790 --> 00:13:13.950
But you did dance really well in that video.

00:13:14.580 --> 00:13:16.510
Thanks to you, Kuro.

00:13:16.510 --> 00:13:17.700
Me?

00:13:19.950 --> 00:13:23.770
<i>It was your advice that 
helped me make my comeback.</i>

00:13:24.250 --> 00:13:26.560
<i>Without that, I never 
could've pulled it off.</i>

00:13:27.420 --> 00:13:31.700
<i>And yet you don't even remember all that.</i>

00:13:31.700 --> 00:13:32.670
Haru?

00:13:37.430 --> 00:13:40.450
<i>I'm sad that you've lost your memories.</i>

00:13:44.870 --> 00:13:46.710
Thank you, Haru.

00:13:46.710 --> 00:13:49.050
Those tears are for me, aren't they?

00:13:49.340 --> 00:13:50.220
Kuro...

00:13:50.610 --> 00:13:52.720
Your big sister is so happy.

00:13:53.330 --> 00:13:56.580
Haru... I'll go to your agency with you.

00:13:56.930 --> 00:13:59.120
Are you interested in show business?

00:13:59.120 --> 00:14:03.470
No, but I want to see through 
whatever decision you make.

00:14:03.830 --> 00:14:04.760
Okay.

00:14:05.290 --> 00:14:06.880
Whoa, hold up!

00:14:06.880 --> 00:14:08.100
Let go of me!

00:14:08.500 --> 00:14:09.680
Kachi!

00:14:09.680 --> 00:14:10.590
Su-chan!

00:14:10.590 --> 00:14:12.340
Is it true you're debating going back?

00:14:12.590 --> 00:14:15.070
Wait, how do you know that when 
I only said it just now?!

00:14:16.080 --> 00:14:17.040
That.

00:14:17.310 --> 00:14:19.650
Kachi asked Rena to do it.

00:14:19.970 --> 00:14:20.760
The hell?

00:14:21.330 --> 00:14:22.760
You scare me, miss.

00:14:22.760 --> 00:14:24.650
Kai-kun, you told him.

00:14:24.650 --> 00:14:26.630
So what if I did? Huh?

00:14:26.810 --> 00:14:28.460
I hate you!

00:14:28.740 --> 00:14:31.830
You have no fear of making 
girls hate you, huh?

00:14:31.830 --> 00:14:34.730
Well, I don't care about 
girls who don't like me.

00:14:36.160 --> 00:14:39.320
There, Shiro. Can you 
be satisfied with that?

00:14:39.320 --> 00:14:40.360
Su-chan...

00:14:40.360 --> 00:14:42.890
Damn it, that hurt, Sueharu.

00:14:42.890 --> 00:14:46.490
What? It changed the subject, so you 
should be thanking me, Tetsuhiko.

00:14:46.690 --> 00:14:50.750
What did you say?! I just 
got punched for nothing!

00:14:47.500 --> 00:14:50.010
Why don't you bring your 
lunch in, too, Kachi-san?

00:14:50.010 --> 00:14:52.250
This is gonna take a while.

00:14:50.750 --> 00:14:52.440
You're the one who picked a fight!

00:14:52.450 --> 00:14:53.950
<b>"...20 Minutes Later"</b>

00:14:55.970 --> 00:15:01.790
Kachi, your goal is to get Sueharu to play 
the lead in a story you wrote, yeah?

00:15:01.790 --> 00:15:03.890
That's right. So what?

00:15:03.890 --> 00:15:07.120
So you're in favor of him returning 
to show business?

00:15:07.350 --> 00:15:08.900
Of course I am.

00:15:08.900 --> 00:15:11.440
I want to see Su-chan in action again.

00:15:11.440 --> 00:15:12.880
Aren't you contradicting yourself?

00:15:13.070 --> 00:15:16.600
Quit beating around the bush. 
What are you getting at?

00:15:16.600 --> 00:15:20.690
Huh... That's pretty sharp, for you.

00:15:21.320 --> 00:15:22.780
"Ultramarine Channel"?

00:15:22.770 --> 00:15:29.860
<b>"Ultramarine Channel"</b>

00:15:23.010 --> 00:15:26.820
I was thinking about what to do 
with the entertainment club,

00:15:26.820 --> 00:15:29.850
and this is one of the 
directions I want to take.

00:15:29.860 --> 00:15:33.370
<b>"Set up WeTube channel 'Ultramarine Channel'
 for the entertainment club"

00:15:30.090 --> 00:15:33.360
And the theme is... 
"we'll do whatever's fun"?

00:15:33.360 --> 00:15:36.680
So the entertainment club's 
gonna become WeTubers?

00:15:36.680 --> 00:15:40.190
That's one part of it, but not all.

00:15:40.630 --> 00:15:43.880
Are you planning to join some acting agency?

00:15:43.880 --> 00:15:46.020
If I do go back, that'll be the plan, yeah.

00:15:46.020 --> 00:15:49.560
If you get super busy with constant work,
 will you quit school?

00:15:50.500 --> 00:15:51.720
You see?

00:15:51.720 --> 00:15:55.840
Shouldn't you enjoy doing high school 
stuff while you're still in high school?

00:15:55.840 --> 00:15:57.080
That's all I was thinking.

00:15:57.520 --> 00:16:00.040
You can go into show business as an adult,

00:16:00.040 --> 00:16:01.830
but this is all the time 
you get in high school.

00:16:01.830 --> 00:16:02.880
True...

00:16:03.320 --> 00:16:04.310
And Kachi...

00:16:04.640 --> 00:16:08.000
If you want Sueharu to star 
in a story you wrote,

00:16:08.000 --> 00:16:10.420
you don't have to make it
 into a film or TV show.

00:16:10.420 --> 00:16:13.050
You can make it on our Ultramarine Channel.

00:16:13.360 --> 00:16:15.280
You're after my fame?

00:16:15.520 --> 00:16:18.060
Yep, there's that, of course.

00:16:18.060 --> 00:16:21.880
But more than that, we need someone 
who can plan and write stories.

00:16:21.880 --> 00:16:26.880
I get the feeling you're the only one 
who can bring out the best in Sueharu.

00:16:27.450 --> 00:16:28.580
Am I wrong?

00:16:28.810 --> 00:16:31.150
Just who do you think I am?

00:16:31.150 --> 00:16:35.550
There's no one who can bring out 
the best in Su-chan like I can.

00:16:35.550 --> 00:16:40.180
I feel like you're only telling us 
the most convenient parts of this.

00:16:40.660 --> 00:16:46.110
Frankly, talking about doing 
fun stuff together isn't you.

00:16:46.110 --> 00:16:48.560
There's a deeper reason 
for this, isn't there?

00:16:49.970 --> 00:16:53.890
Impressive, Shida-chan. 
I won't say there isn't one.

00:16:54.350 --> 00:16:57.490
But that doesn't mean everything 
I just said was a lie.

00:16:57.490 --> 00:16:58.870
I promise you that.

00:17:00.380 --> 00:17:02.320
We won't ask any more, then.

00:17:02.610 --> 00:17:03.790
Su-chan...

00:17:04.000 --> 00:17:07.860
Tetsuhiko won't tell us any more than 
he wants to anyway, even if we ask.

00:17:09.490 --> 00:17:14.150
And as much as I hate to admit it, 
this honestly sounds like fun to me.

00:17:14.150 --> 00:17:19.100
It feels like we're working day and night in 
some secret base to achieve world domination.

00:17:19.100 --> 00:17:20.550
It's exactly my kinda thing.

00:17:20.800 --> 00:17:24.300
So the first members would 
be me, you, and Shiro?

00:17:24.440 --> 00:17:26.950
No, Shida-chan's included, too.

00:17:29.010 --> 00:17:32.340
Tetsuhiko, let me take this plan home.

00:17:32.340 --> 00:17:36.450
After I talk to the agency, I'll decide 
whether to go back or do this with you.

00:17:36.450 --> 00:17:37.520
Deal?

00:17:37.520 --> 00:17:41.810
Sure, but in that case, Sueharu, 
take me to your agency with you.

00:17:41.810 --> 00:17:43.740
Huh? Why you?

00:17:45.890 --> 00:17:46.700
Please.

00:17:48.520 --> 00:17:51.030
Yeah, all right, all right.

00:17:51.030 --> 00:17:52.710
Just don't be in the way.

00:17:53.040 --> 00:17:56.040
I know. I'll just be 
tagging along this time.

00:17:56.330 --> 00:17:57.770
I want to go, too.

00:17:58.030 --> 00:18:01.270
I just want to be with you and 
hear what's being discussed.

00:18:01.270 --> 00:18:01.920
Can I?

00:18:02.180 --> 00:18:03.230
All right.

00:18:04.640 --> 00:18:08.100
<b>"Ultramarine Channel"</b>

00:18:05.000 --> 00:18:07.870
<i>Show business or everyday life...</i>

00:18:11.140 --> 00:18:15.120
<i>You were right, Akane. I have 
to look at this positively.</i>

00:18:18.730 --> 00:18:20.670
Hardy Pro...

00:18:20.670 --> 00:18:24.160
This is where you and I first met, too.

00:18:24.650 --> 00:18:26.110
What's your name?

00:18:26.530 --> 00:18:27.960
Die, jerk.

00:18:28.460 --> 00:18:32.750
You snapped at everyone and never tried 
to fit in. You were a real handful.

00:18:33.270 --> 00:18:35.510
But over time, I realized

00:18:35.510 --> 00:18:38.560
that the things you did to mess with 
me were unbelievably precise.

00:18:38.890 --> 00:18:42.400
It made me think, "Wait, maybe 
she's actually really talented?"

00:18:42.400 --> 00:18:45.840
From then on, your acting 
was the only thing I loved.

00:18:46.420 --> 00:18:49.090
<i>You were normally so boring,</i>

00:18:49.090 --> 00:18:51.560
<i>but when you were acting, you changed.</i>

00:18:51.830 --> 00:18:56.640
<i>Your talent was specialized 
for entertaining people.</i>

00:18:56.640 --> 00:18:58.970
<i>So I always thought,</i>

00:18:58.970 --> 00:19:01.760
<i>"His talent is so pure."</i>

00:19:02.500 --> 00:19:05.590
Make me believe in you, Sueharu-oniichan.

00:19:06.510 --> 00:19:07.610
Did you say something?

00:19:07.610 --> 00:19:09.310
No, nothing!

00:19:15.290 --> 00:19:17.500
Okay, we're all here.

00:19:17.500 --> 00:19:18.420
Let's go.

00:19:21.080 --> 00:19:24.270
Wow, Maru-chan in the flesh! Nice!

00:19:24.270 --> 00:19:27.100
You've got an aura to you! Oh, yeah!

00:19:27.100 --> 00:19:29.680
I don't know what it is, but I dig it.

00:19:29.680 --> 00:19:33.540
No, President, you're the 
one with the intense aura!

00:19:33.540 --> 00:19:36.310
You must be the personification of dandyism!

00:19:36.310 --> 00:19:37.040
Really?

00:19:37.040 --> 00:19:37.660
Haru...

00:19:37.660 --> 00:19:38.660
Su-chan...

00:19:38.820 --> 00:19:41.770
That's my Sueharu-oniichan! Well done!

00:19:44.380 --> 00:19:47.450
So what do you say, Maru-chan? 
Gonna make a comeback?

00:19:47.450 --> 00:19:48.810
You are, right?

00:19:48.810 --> 00:19:52.040
Well, actually... I'm having trouble deciding.

00:19:52.040 --> 00:19:53.660
I'd have to balance it with school.

00:19:53.660 --> 00:19:55.500
What are you talking about?

00:19:55.500 --> 00:19:57.670
This is the time to strike it rich!

00:19:57.670 --> 00:20:00.400
You shouldn't be worrying 
about going to school.

00:20:00.400 --> 00:20:01.430
Right?

00:20:01.430 --> 00:20:03.300
Well, I mean, uh...

00:20:04.220 --> 00:20:07.600
Shida-chan, you want to 
make your debut, right?

00:20:07.600 --> 00:20:08.730
Don't you?

00:20:08.730 --> 00:20:10.760
Um, about that...

00:20:10.760 --> 00:20:13.340
You're not going to tell 
me you don't, are you?

00:20:16.320 --> 00:20:19.770
Yes, I came here today to decline that offer.

00:20:23.150 --> 00:20:26.810
Shida-chan, if you debut 
with Maru-chan right now,

00:20:26.810 --> 00:20:28.840
you can make 100 million in three years.

00:20:30.070 --> 00:20:33.030
And Maru-chan, you could make 
300 million in three years.

00:20:33.030 --> 00:20:36.910
If all goes as I'm planning it, 
those amounts are entirely possible.

00:20:36.910 --> 00:20:38.080
Three hundred million...

00:20:38.710 --> 00:20:41.080
Tetsuhiko! If I make that much,

00:20:41.080 --> 00:20:44.000
I could ask Rena to do pervy stuff 
and she wouldn't blab, right?!

00:20:44.000 --> 00:20:47.700
The fact that your mind went there 
is so disgusting, even I'm shocked.

00:20:47.700 --> 00:20:48.560
Haru...

00:20:48.850 --> 00:20:50.100
Su-chan...

00:20:50.680 --> 00:20:55.600
Don't worry. I'll train you all 
over again from the inside out.

00:20:57.350 --> 00:21:03.160
Actually, I've got a big sponsor that 
wants Maru-chan to star in a commercial.

00:21:03.160 --> 00:21:05.420
They'll be dropping by here later.

00:21:05.420 --> 00:21:08.230
I'd like you to just meet 
them and say hello.

00:21:08.230 --> 00:21:12.910
And if you're also in the commercial, 
Shida-chan, it'll be even bigger news!

00:21:12.910 --> 00:21:16.590
You'll do it, right, Shida-chan? 
We're talking 100 million here.

00:21:16.590 --> 00:21:20.160
Well... I do appreciate the offer,

00:21:20.520 --> 00:21:21.520
but I'm sorry.

00:21:21.520 --> 00:21:23.860
Didn't you just say you appreciated it?

00:21:23.860 --> 00:21:26.000
Then what reason is there not to do it?

00:21:26.270 --> 00:21:29.290
I'm saying... Money is important,

00:21:29.290 --> 00:21:30.900
but my priorities are those close to—

00:21:30.900 --> 00:21:35.080
With money, you could make life 
easier for all those close to you.

00:21:35.080 --> 00:21:37.310
Don't you want to take good 
care of your parents?

00:21:37.310 --> 00:21:40.210
Of course I do, but...

00:21:40.210 --> 00:21:42.640
Then do it. Get into show business.

00:21:43.130 --> 00:21:43.970
Hey—

00:21:43.240 --> 00:21:45.790
As I've told you several times now,

00:21:45.790 --> 00:21:47.600
I came here today to decline—

00:21:47.600 --> 00:21:50.870
Shida-chan, you're no fun at all.

00:21:50.870 --> 00:21:52.960
Maybe your parents didn't raise you right?

00:22:06.330 --> 00:22:08.990
Don't you dare make fun 
of my childhood friend.
